00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,924
Ask your agent for total sales. Which number do you get?

2
00:00:04,024 --> 00:00:10,002
In our example shaped like SAP CDS views, the order total sits on the sales document header.

3
00:00:10,102 --> 00:00:14,925
Join it to its items, and an order counts up to 3 times: 1 900.

4
00:00:15,025 --> 00:00:17,486
Summed once per order: 700.

5
00:00:17,586 --> 00:00:22,144
Krusgraph flags this against your rows, so the agent can sum at the right level.

6
00:00:22,494 --> 00:00:26,399
Try it in your browser: krusgraph.com/check
